# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Repository-root ignore rules.
#
# Added during Phase 0 stabilisation. Before this file existed there was NO
# .gitignore at the repository root and none in dashboard/api/, so
# dashboard/api/.secrets.local.txt would have been committed by the first
# `git add .`. See AUDIT_FLUTTER_APP.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Secrets: never commit ---
.secrets*
*.secret
*.secrets
secrets.*
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.sample
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
key.properties
*service-account*.json
*credentials*.json

# --- Flutter / Dart ---
app_main/build/
app_main/.dart_tool/
app_main/.flutter-plugins
app_main/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
app_main/android/local.properties
app_main/android/.gradle/
app_main/android/.kotlin/
app_main/ios/Pods/
app_main/.idea/

# --- Node / Cloudflare Workers ---
node_modules/
dist/
.wrangler/
.wrangler-dry-run/
# مخرَج بناء التحقّق في CI (`OPS-105`): يُنتَج في كل جولة ولا يُراجَع.
.wrangler-ci/
*.log
tail.log

# --- Python ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# --- Kiro operational reports ---
# Operational task reporting, deliberately kept out of production commits.
KIRO_LAST_REPORT.md
KIRO_REPORT_HISTORY.md
KIRO_IDE_LAST.md

# --- Local scratch / archives ---
_archive/
*.rar

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw image masters — EXCLUDED FROM VERSION CONTROL, DECISION PENDING
#
# `majarra_images/` is 568 MB of full-resolution PNG/JPEG masters (including
# many obvious download duplicates named "... (1).png"). Committing it would
# bake 568 MB into git history permanently and cannot be undone without a
# history rewrite, so it is excluded from the baseline commit.
#
# The files are UNTOUCHED on disk. The app does not load them at runtime — it
# ships compressed WebP from `app_main/assets/`. This directory is a pipeline
# input (see tools/process_planet_icons.py).
#
# Pick one before relying on git for these:
#   1. Git LFS      -> `git lfs track "majarra_images/**"` then remove this rule.
#   2. Object storage (R2/S3) -> keep this rule; back the masters up there.
#   3. Track anyway -> remove this rule, accepting a permanently large repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
majarra_images/


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Catalogue-audit artefacts (generated, not source).
#
# `scripts/_audit_*` are the reproducible generators and ARE tracked. What they
# emit is not: the change set is large, regenerable, and specific to one run.
# The D1 copy is a local safety net taken before the audit's write phase.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
dashboard/api/_audit_apply.sql
dashboard/api/_content.json
dashboard/api/_MASTER_INVENTORY.txt
dashboard/api/_d1_backup_before_audit/
dashboard/api/_slate_load.sql
dashboard/api/_manifests.json
dashboard/api/_d1_backup_before_slate/
dashboard/api/_completion_load.sql
dashboard/api/_d1_backup_before_migrations/
dashboard/api/_d1_backup_before_completion/
# Full production exports are local recovery material and may contain user data.
dashboard/api/_d1_backup_prod_*/

# Editor/manual replacement scratch files are not source artifacts.
*.dart.new

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local media masters and safety copies — never committed.
#
# Measured on 2026-08-09: `videos/` is 1.29 GB of raw episode footage plus the
# delivery zip, `assets/` is 32 MB of image/audio masters, `audio/` holds raw
# narration takes. None of it is loaded at runtime — the app ships compressed
# assets from `app_main/assets/` and the API serves from R2 — so committing it
# would bake over a gigabyte into history for no runtime benefit, and that is
# not reversible without a history rewrite.
#
# `_backups/` are point-in-time copies of the local D1 sqlite file taken before
# destructive migrations. They are a local safety net, not source.
#
# The files stay untouched on disk. Same options as `majarra_images/` above:
# Git LFS, object storage, or an explicit decision to accept the repo size.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
videos/
assets/
# New runtime artwork belongs in Flutter's bundled asset tree. Keep the broad
# raw-master exclusion above while allowing reviewed production files only.
!app_main/assets/
app_main/assets/**
!app_main/assets/data/
app_main/assets/data/**
!app_main/assets/data/prompt_items.json
# Colouring page catalogue: plain image list, hand-editable.
!app_main/assets/data/coloring_pages.json
!app_main/assets/images/
app_main/assets/images/**
!app_main/assets/images/explore/
!app_main/assets/images/explore/*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/landing/
!app_main/assets/images/landing/login-phone.jpg
!app_main/assets/images/landing/login-tablet.jpg
!app_main/assets/images/landing/login-tv.jpg
# Colouring pages: ordinary pictures a child paints on top of. Any raster format
# the Flutter image decoder handles is fine, so no format is privileged here.
!app_main/assets/images/coloring/
!app_main/assets/images/coloring/*.png
!app_main/assets/images/coloring/*.jpg
!app_main/assets/images/coloring/*.jpeg
!app_main/assets/images/coloring/*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/seasonal/
app_main/assets/images/seasonal/**
!app_main/assets/images/seasonal/winter.webp
!app_main/assets/images/books/
!app_main/assets/images/books/*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/games/
app_main/assets/images/games/**
!app_main/assets/images/games/game-engine-*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/series/
app_main/assets/images/series/**
!app_main/assets/images/series/banners/
app_main/assets/images/series/banners/**
!app_main/assets/images/series/banners/try-it-at-home-banner.webp
!app_main/assets/images/drawing/
app_main/assets/images/drawing/**
!app_main/assets/images/drawing/covers/
app_main/assets/images/drawing/covers/**
!app_main/assets/images/drawing/covers/prompt-*.webp
# Creative Studio chrome. Only the reviewed WebP derivatives are tracked; the raw
# provider JPEGs they came from stay under the ignored tools/playveo/output tree.
!app_main/assets/images/studio/
app_main/assets/images/studio/**
!app_main/assets/images/studio/hero-*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/studio/card-*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/studio/icon-*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/stories/
app_main/assets/images/stories/**
!app_main/assets/images/stories/act-s2-playveo/
!app_main/assets/images/stories/act-s2-playveo/*.webp
!app_main/assets/images/stories/act-s3-playveo/
!app_main/assets/images/stories/act-s3-playveo/*.webp
audio/
_backups/
# `.backups/` بنقطة، لا بشرطة سفلية.
#
# القاعدة أعلاه (`_backups/`) كانت تغطّي مجلدًا واحدًا، بينما النسخ الفعلية
# لقاعدة الإنتاج كانت تُكتب في `.backups/` — حرف واحد من الفرق. النتيجة أن
# `.backups/majarra-db-prod-pre-0076-20260823.sql` (1.38 ميغابايت من بيانات
# إنتاج حقيقية) كان **غير مُتجاهَل**، فأمر `git add -A` واحد كان يرفعه إلى
# التاريخ حيث لا يمكن سحبه إلا بإعادة كتابة التاريخ. وشجرة العمل فيها 292
# مسارًا غير متتبَّع، أي أن `git add -A` ليس افتراضًا نظريًّا.
.backups/

# Generated media-pipeline intermediates and local review reports.
# Runtime assets live under app_main/assets; these can be regenerated locally.
tools/playveo/output/
tools/playveo/archive/
tools/playveo/contact-sheets/
.audit/
semantic-review/

# Coverage output. Regenerated by `flutter test --coverage`; the number that
# matters is the floor in tools/ci/coverage-floor.mjs, which is committed.
app_main/coverage/
coverage/

# `majarra-playveo-studio/` هو **مستودع git مستقل** له `.git` خاص، لا مجلد محتوى.
# المقيس: 1.27 غيغابايت في 9,275 ملفًا، منها `src-tauri/` 1.11 غ و`node_modules/`
# 140 م — أي أن `git add -A` في المستودع الأب يحاول ابتلاع مستودعٍ آخر بكامل
# مخرجات بنائه. يُدار من مستودعه، ولا يُرتكب هنا لا كملفات ولا كـsubmodule بلا
# قرار صريح.
majarra-playveo-studio/

# مخلَّفات توليد وتحقّق مؤقتة، لا أصول إنتاج.
# `.tmp_covers/` مسرح توليد الأغلفة (51 ميغابايت في 183 ملفًا) — المشتقّات
# المعتمدة تُرفع إلى R2 وتُشار إليها بـCDN، فلا معنى لحفظ المسرح في التاريخ.
# و`.tmp-*` في اللوحة لقطات وسجلات تحقّق تُكتب أثناء العمل.
.tmp_covers/
dashboard/front/.tmp-*
dashboard/front/dev-front.log
dashboard/front/devfront.log

# مخلَّفات محرِّر: نسخة ثانية من ملف بجانب الأصل. تُعالج بحذفها لا بحفظها.
*.tsx.new

# مخرجات تشغيل خط إنتاج الأصول، لا مصادر.
# حالة الاستئناف النقطية (`.qisas-bulk-state.json` وأمثالها) **يكتبها** السكربت
# أثناء الدفعة ويقرأها ليُكمل، فحفظها في التاريخ يجمّد حالة دفعةٍ بعينها.
# و`*.results.json` **لا يقرأها شيء** — مُقيس بالبحث في `tools/`.
# والسجلات نصٌّ مطبوع من جولةٍ انقضت.
tools/playveo/.*.json
tools/playveo/*.results.json
tools/playveo/*log*.txt
tools/playveo/last-run*.log
tools/*_gen.log

# بيانات دخول بنصٍّ صريح لحساب تجريبي: بريد وكلمة مرور وPIN والدين.
# `tools/ci/scan-secrets.mjs` لا يرصدها لأنها ليست سرًّا عالي العشوائية، وهذا
# بالضبط سبب كتابة القاعدة يدويًّا: «تجريبيّ» لا يعني «قابل للنشر»، وحساب الوالد
# يفتح منطقة أولياء الأمور. تُتبادَل عبر قناة الأسرار لا عبر التاريخ.
DEMO_FAMILY_ACCOUNT.txt
